{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And you shall make an altar, etc.</b> The reason that this inner vessel was arranged after the entire Tabernacle and its service, I have already explained in parashat Terumah at the verse (Exodus 25:9) ״וְכֵן תַּעֲשׂוּ״. And His saying <b>תַּעֲשֶׂה</b> comes to exclude the work that Solomon made, which was not of acacia wood, for it was entirely gold." "<b>Thus concludes parashat Tetzaveh</b>"], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:34:33.037662676Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}